  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing Smart Water Resources Modelling Centre at CWC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aiming at establishing the Smart Water Resources Modelling Centre at CWC (India) as part of a strategic agreement between Ministry of Jal Shakti, Govt. of India and Ministry of Environment, Govt. of Denmark. The Centre of Excellence will aim to provide Central Water Commission, India with the best practices and technology within the area of Water Resources management.</narrative>
